WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.185 --> 00:00:11.670
In tutorial 5.7, you'll answer the
keyword Alaventra suggests next: start it,

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.494
swap it, or turn it down.

00:00:14.525 --> 00:00:16.950
First, when you have
room for another keyword,

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.010
your Pipeline shows it under Needs you,
and in its own card, A keyword we suggest.

00:00:23.475 --> 00:00:27.360
The card shows your chances, how
many people search it, the plan,

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:30.202
the credits of each page,
and why it's suggested.

00:00:31.979 --> 00:00:36.089
Then choose. Start this ladder
starts it, and Not now turns it down.

00:00:36.139 --> 00:00:37.948
Nothing starts without your OK.

00:00:40.004 --> 00:00:44.729
Show me others opens the easiest
suggestions that no ladder covers yet.

00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:46.727
Click one to start it instead.

00:00:47.954 --> 00:00:52.204
When you click Start this ladder, a
box called Check this first opens.

00:00:52.254 --> 00:00:56.354
It says this starts a new keyword
ladder, writes its first page now,

00:00:56.404 --> 00:00:58.460
and about how many credits that takes.

00:00:59.464 --> 00:01:02.489
It also names any ladder
this keyword overlaps,

00:01:02.539 --> 00:01:05.064
and offers to add it
to that ladder instead,

00:01:05.114 --> 00:01:07.855
so your pages don't compete
for the same buyers.

00:01:08.845 --> 00:01:13.545
The safer choice is Plan it without
writing a page, which costs fewer credits.

00:01:13.595 --> 00:01:15.958
Or click Cancel, and nothing starts.

00:01:16.952 --> 00:01:21.577
On full autopilot, the next keyword is
announced two days before it starts,

00:01:21.627 --> 00:01:24.212
in a card called Your
next keyword starts soon.

00:01:25.973 --> 00:01:29.123
Approve now asks you to
confirm, then starts it.

00:01:29.173 --> 00:01:32.248
Pick a different one swaps
it, and Skip turns it down.

00:01:32.298 --> 00:01:34.729
Do nothing, and it
starts on the date shown.

00:01:35.691 --> 00:01:39.067
Back in Show me others, you can
also type your own keyword here,

00:01:39.117 --> 00:01:40.775
then click Check and start.

00:01:43.233 --> 00:01:47.493
Your keyword is checked first, and
starts only if it fits your website.

00:01:47.543 --> 00:01:50.653
If it doesn't, pick one of
these suggestions instead.

00:01:51.737 --> 00:01:55.512
Now your weekly pages always
go to a keyword you agreed to,

00:01:55.562 --> 00:01:57.159
or one you chose yourself.

00:01:58.758 --> 00:02:03.848
So: find the suggestion, start it or say
not now, check what starting it does,

00:02:03.898 --> 00:02:07.314
know what full autopilot does,
and type your own keyword.

00:02:08.288 --> 00:02:10.938
Your next keyword is your call. Next,

00:02:10.988 --> 00:02:16.871
write the pages Alaventra suggests and
see what runs on its own, in tutorial 5.8.
